  "body": "The vendor has reduced the price and is offering the property below CV\r\n\r\nWelcome to 2 Myra G Place, a remarkable and expansive residence in the heart of Stanmore Bay. Perfect for large families, investors, or multi-generational living, this property offers 10 spacious bedrooms and 5 modern bathrooms across 380 sqm (approx.) of thoughtfully designed living space.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n* 10 generously sized rooms for family or guests\r\n* 5 modern bathrooms + 1 additional guest toilet\r\n* Double garage with extra storage\r\n* Approx.4,355 sqm of outdoor space for recreation and relaxation\r\n\r\nStep inside to find a harmonious blend of architectural elegance and modern comfort. Features include hardwood flooring, stylish home décor, and expansive living areas perfect for entertaining. The dining room and balcony provide serene spaces to enjoy family gatherings or unwind with views of the lush surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe sprawling grounds offer endless possibilities for outdoor living - ideal for summer barbecues, gardening, play, or simply enjoying the tranquility of nature.\r\n\r\nSituated in the highly sought-after Stanmore Bay, this home is close to local amenities, schools, and beautiful distant sea view, offering the perfect balance of community and convenience.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property presents a rare opportunity for a family home or investment. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing and explore the potential of this magnificent home.",
